<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1298986140"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1416550480"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Moonlight"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="潘玮柏 / 袁娅维TIA RAY"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Moonlight"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:12.232"><div begin="00:01.965" end="03:08.403"><p begin="00:01.965" end="00:07.603" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L1">M-m-m-ma, and go, m-m-ma, for, don't need no more, m-m-mum</p><p begin="00:08.117" end="00:10.890" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L2">I don't ever stare into the sunlight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从来不抬头直视太阳</span></p><p begin="00:10.906" end="00:13.530" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L3">Toss 'em up, I'm about to take flight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为总是专注掌控一切 准备起航</span></p><p begin="00:13.556" end="00:16.263" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L4">I'm feelin' like a champ under these strange times<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管面对任何诡异的局势 我都像个冠军</span></p><p begin="00:16.410" end="00:18.695" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5">Rollie on my wrist, shout out to big time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">手上的Rolex证明我是个大人物</span></p><p begin="00:18.802" end="00:21.282" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L6">Mama told me don't take no for an answer, I didn't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妈妈说过别对任何问题轻易说不</span></p><p begin="00:21.327" end="00:24.076" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L7">There's new commas every time I deposit the digits<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全力血拼 看着存折数字又增加了逗点</span></p><p begin="00:24.298" end="00:26.815" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L8">Mama, look at what we got, we finally did it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妈妈 让你见证我的出息 我们做到了</span></p><p begin="00:27.039" end="00:29.557" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L9">You can't tell me that we not, this gotta be livin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不接受任何质疑 因为我成功活出人生</span></p><p begin="00:29.639" end="00:32.327" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L10">And everything I do, I wanna put a shine on it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的每一步都要它发光发热</span></p><p begin="00:32.517" end="00:35.082" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L11">Make 'em miss, when I lose I put my name on it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成功失败 赢或输 刻在我的名字背面</span></p><p begin="00:35.272" end="00:37.370" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L12">Raise your hands and let it reach for the sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高举双手 伸向天空</span></p><p begin="00:37.370" end="00:40.189" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L13">Know that everything will be alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切 都会be alright</span></p><p begin="00:39.331" end="00:44.293" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Oh, and this is everything I wanted</p><p begin="00:44.557" end="00:49.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Do it one more time, gotta give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次尝试</span></p><p begin="00:49.862" end="00:51.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p><p begin="00:51.974" end="00:55.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">See the stars under the moonlight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着月光下的星空</span></p><p begin="00:55.414" end="01:00.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Do it one more time, gotta give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次尝试</span></p><p begin="01:00.720" end="01:03.027" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">I give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p><p begin="01:02.646" end="01:05.458" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20">Went from eatin' ramen noodles, now it's steak knives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经三餐泡面 现在能品尝人生滋味</span></p><p begin="01:05.458" end="01:08.013" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21">Private planes, run ways to the west side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">私人飞机 一路飞向西岸</span></p><p begin="01:08.104" end="01:11.528" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22">Boss 'em up, I'm about to take flight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着我大动作的起飞</span></p><p begin="01:11.553" end="01:13.585" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23">All cash, no brake lights<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">催起油 跟不上我的尾灯</span></p><p begin="01:13.673" end="01:16.158" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24">Mama told me don't be trippin' over haters hatin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妈妈说别在乎嫉妒和酸民</span></p><p begin="01:16.243" end="01:18.955" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25">It's love and peace and respect the motto oh, we chasin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱 和平 尊重 才是人生座右铭</span></p><p begin="01:19.065" end="01:21.689" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26">Mama told me, wipe your face when them tears were fallin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妈妈说过有泪不轻弹</span></p><p begin="01:21.726" end="01:24.350" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L27">You know I always light it up, this gotta be livin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我总是带着笑容突破 因为我成功活出人生</span></p><p begin="01:24.528" end="01:27.264" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28">And everything I do, I wanna put a shine on it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的每一步都要它发光发热</span></p><p begin="01:27.357" end="01:29.885" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29">Make 'em miss, when I lose I put my name on it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成功失败 赢或输 刻在我的名字背面</span></p><p begin="01:30.071" end="01:32.218" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L30">Raise your hands and let it reach for the sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高举双手 伸向天空</span></p><p begin="01:32.218" end="01:34.966" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L31">Know that everything will be alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切 都会be alright</span></p><p begin="01:34.248" end="01:39.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Oh, this is everything I wanted</p><p begin="01:39.317" end="01:44.173" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Do it one more time, gotta give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次尝试</span></p><p begin="01:44.660" end="01:46.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">I give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p><p begin="01:46.812" end="01:50.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">See the stars under the moonlight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着月光下的星空</span></p><p begin="01:50.294" end="01:55.409" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Do it one more time, gotta give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次尝试</span></p><p begin="01:55.780" end="01:57.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p><p begin="02:00.615" end="02:03.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Gotta give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今夜释放我们的所有</span></p><p begin="02:06.573" end="02:09.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p><p begin="02:10.133" end="02:12.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">No</p><p begin="02:19.471" end="02:21.988" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L41">Mama told me don't take no for an answer, I didn't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妈妈说过别对任何问题轻易说不</span></p><p begin="02:22.070" end="02:24.814" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L42">There's new commas every time I deposit the digits<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全力血拼 看着存折数字又增加了逗点</span></p><p begin="02:24.971" end="02:27.558" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L43">Mama, look at what we got, we finally did it (Ooh-ah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妈妈 让你见证我的出息 我们做到了</span></p><p begin="02:27.617" end="02:30.252" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L44">You can't tell me that we not, this gotta be livin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不接受任何质疑 因为我成功活出人生</span></p><p begin="02:31.818" end="02:32.956" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L45">This gotta be livin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我成功活出人生</span></p><p begin="02:33.465" end="02:36.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">This is everything I wanted<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一刻就是我想要的</span></p><p begin="02:37.009" end="02:41.736" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Do it one more time, gotta give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次尝试</span></p><p begin="02:42.257" end="02:44.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">I give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p><p begin="02:44.401" end="02:47.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">See the stars under the moonlight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着月光下的星空</span></p><p begin="02:47.931" end="02:53.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Do it one more time, gotta give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次尝试</span></p><p begin="02:53.170" end="02:55.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">You give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p><p begin="02:58.797" end="03:00.912" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">I give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p><p begin="03:04.261" end="03:08.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">I give it up all night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放给夜空</span></p></div></body></tt>